ard" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Ultimate Guide to Nail Shapes: Which is Your Favourite? | Justlife"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Hey there, beauty aficionados! Ever stood in front of a salon mirror pondering the eternal question, &quot;What nail shape speaks to me?&quot; You&#x27;re not alone. Let&#x27;s dive into the fabulous world of nails and discover which shape is your soulmate."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1280x853/ec2f087705/nail-shapes.webp"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="280"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="280"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="The Ultimate Guide to Nail Shapes: Which is Your Favourite? | Justlife"/><link rel="icon" href="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/x/a043724372/jl-favicon.ico"/><script>document.querySelectorAll('body link[rel="icon"], body link[rel="apple-touch-icon"]').forEach(el => document.head.appendChild(el))</script><script src="/blog/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class="Header_headerContainer__RZem_"><div class="Header_headerWrapper__xLzp9"><a target="_self" class="Header_logoWrapper__8YDWS" href="/blog/en-AE"><img alt="logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="eager" width="170" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="Header_logoImage__wL82F" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:7.083333333333333" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/173x24/7981607c7b/cleanslate-logo.svg"/><p class="Header_brandName__Mwg9r">by Justlife</p></a><a hrefLang="ar-AE" target="_self" class="Chip_chipContainer__KMeax Chip_default__xuX8i LanguageSwitchButton_languageSwitchButton__wZ1IW" href="/blog/ar-AE/nailing-it-finding-your-perfect-nail-shape"><p class="text-subtitle-1 text-white g-inline-block">العربية</p></a></div></div><div id="blogdetail-page-container"><div class="bg-white g-flow-root"><div class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbGroupContainer__w36yz"><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f  text-subtitle-1" href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE">Home</a><img alt="chevron-right" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="8" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:0.6666666666666666" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg"/><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f  text-subtitle-1" href="/blog/en-AE">Blog</a><img alt="chevron-right" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="8" height="12" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:0.6666666666666666" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg"/><a class="Breadcrumb_breadcrumbItem__D7J_f Breadcrumb_disabled__4ca9w text-subtitle-1" href="/blog/en-AE/nailing-it-finding-your-perfect-nail-shape">Nailing It: Finding Your Perfect Nail Shape</a></div><div class="HighlightSection_highlightContainer__lVTle"><div class="HighlightSection_highlightSectionTextSection__Pk59k"><h1 class="HighlightSection_highlightTitle__WwNfj">Nailing It: Finding Your Perfect Nail Shape</h1><p class="HighlightSection_highlightDescription__CwibP">Hey there, beauty aficionados! Ever stood in front of a salon mirror pondering the eternal question, &quot;What nail shape speaks to me?&quot; You&#x27;re not alone. Let&#x27;s dive into the fabulous world of nails and discover which shape is your soulmate.</p><div class="HighlightSection_bookNowContainer__P1EZr"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardContainer__P7nfG"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardLogoWrapper__xLuMU"><img alt="justlife-logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="140" height="44" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BookNowCard_bookNowLogo__onpra" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:3.1818181818181817" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/140x45/86979fd21d/justlife-logo-blue.svg"/></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardDescriptionWrapper__oTOKg"><p class="">Need things sorted fast? Book UAE’s favorite home services on Justlife.</p></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardButtonWrapper__FmEn6"><a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/beauty-for-her/checkout/flex?utm_source=BlogPost&amp;utm_campaign=nailing-it-finding-your-perfect-nail-shape" target="_blank" class="BookNowCard_bookNowButton__UxmTi text-body-1">Book now</a></div></div></div></div><div class="HighlightSection_highlightImageWrapper__j4SaC"><img alt="highlight-img" fetchPriority="high" loading="eager" width="359" height="333" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="HighlightSection_highlightImage__jXtae" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.078078078078078" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1280x853/ec2f087705/nail-shapes.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div></div><div class="BookNowSection_bookNowContainer__Bi7B5"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardContainer__P7nfG"><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardLogoWrapper__xLuMU"><img alt="justlife-logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="140" height="44" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BookNowCard_bookNowLogo__onpra" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:3.1818181818181817" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/140x45/86979fd21d/justlife-logo-blue.svg"/></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardDescriptionWrapper__oTOKg"><p class="">Need things sorted fast? Book UAE’s favorite home services on Justlife.</p></div><div class="BookNowCard_bookNowCardButtonWrapper__FmEn6"><a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/beauty-for-her/checkout/flex?utm_source=BlogPost&amp;utm_campaign=nailing-it-finding-your-perfect-nail-shape" target="_blank" class="BookNowCard_bookNowButton__UxmTi text-body-1">Book now</a></div></div></div><div class="ContentSection_contentSectionContainer__7lYFU"><p>Hey there, beauty aficionados! Ever stood in front of a salon mirror pondering the eternal question, "What nail shape speaks to me?" You're not alone. The world of manicures is vast and varied, with types of nail shapes for every mood, personality, and lifestyle. Whether you're a fan of the elegance of oval nails or the daring allure of stiletto nails, there's a shape out there that's your perfect fit. I've teamed up with the experts at Justlife to bring you the ultimate guide to different nail shapes, ensuring your next salon visit is a breeze. Let's dive into the fabulous world of nails and discover which shape is your soulmate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>The Ultimate Guide to Nail Shapes</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Round Shape Nails</strong></h3><p>Simple, classic, and effortlessly chic, round shape nails are the go-to for those who cherish a timeless look. Perfect for shorter nails, they make your fingers appear longer and are a breeze to maintain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Square Nails</strong></h3><p>Bold and striking, square nails are all about making a statement. With their straight edges and sharp corners, they're the epitome of edgy sophistication. Ideal for those with longer nail beds looking to add some drama to their digits.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Oval Nails</strong></h3><p>Oval nails are the essence of elegance. Their elongated shape offers a soft, feminine vibe that works beautifully on any hand. They're incredibly versatile, making them a fantastic pick for nail enthusiasts of all stripes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Squoval Nails</strong></h3><p>Can't decide between square and oval? Squoval nails are your answer. This hybrid shape brings the best of both worlds, offering the strength of square tips with the grace of oval edges. It's a universally flattering shape that's both modern and stylish.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Almond Nails</strong></h3><p>Named after the nut, almond nails are for those who love a bit of drama. Tapering to a rounded point, they elongate the hands and provide a perfect canvas for intricate nail art. Almond nails are a surefire way to add a touch of glamour to your look.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Stiletto Nails</strong></h3><p>Not for the faint of heart, stiletto nails are bold, pointed, and unapologetically fierce. They're a favorite for making a fashion statement and turning heads. While they might not be the most practical, they're perfect for special occasions where you want to stand out.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Coffin Shaped Nails</strong></h3><p>Coffin-shaped nails, or ballerina's nails, are the trendsetters' choice. Tapered with a flat tip, they're sleek, sophisticated, and utterly chic. Popular among celebs, these nails are ideal for those who love to stay ahead of the curve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Short Almond Nails</strong></h3><p>Love the almond look but need something a bit more low-key? Short almond nails have got you covered. Offering the elegance of the almond shape in a more manageable length, they're perfect for everyday glam.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Nail Trends</strong></h2><p>The upcoming year promises an exciting mix of personal expression and versatility in nail trends. Here's what's making waves:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Almond Nails:</strong> Continuing their reign for their sleek, stylish appeal, perfect for those seeking elegance with a dash of modernity.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coffin Shapes:</strong> Bold and fashion-forward, these nails are set to make a statement for those who dare to stand out.</p></li><li><p><strong>Short Square Nails:</strong> Returning with a practical charm, ideal for a neat, clean look that's easy to maintain.</p></li><li><p><strong>Squoval Shapes:</strong> Merging the best of square and oval, squoval nails offer a uniquely practical beauty.</p></li><li><p><strong>Creative Almond Nail Designs:</strong> Serving as a canvas for endless creativity, almond nails invite personalized expressions of style.</p></li><li><p><strong>French Nails:</strong> A timeless classic, French nails are getting a modern twist with new colors and innovative designs, proving once again their enduring appeal.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Pastel Tones:</strong> Soft, soothing pastels will continue to be a favorite, offering a delicate splash of color suitable for any occasion.</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Justlife: Your Ultimate Nail Care Destination</strong></h2><p>At Justlife, we understand that your nails are an extension of your personality. That's why we offer a wide range of nail services tailored to meet your individual needs and preferences. Whether you're looking for the latest almond nail designs, dreaming of sophisticated coffin-shaped nails, or wanting to keep things classic with round or oval nails, our expert technicians are here to make it happen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Personalized Nail Care Services</strong></h3><p>Our services go beyond just applying polish. We offer comprehensive nail care, including:</p><ul><li><p>Consultations: To help you choose the perfect nail shape and design based on your lifestyle, nail health, and personal style.</p></li><li><p>Customized Manicures: From short square nails to stiletto nails, we customize each manicure to suit your chosen shape and finish it with impeccable polish application or nail art.</p></li><li><p>Nail Health Treatments: Ensuring your nails are not only beautiful but healthy too, with treatments that cater to strengthening and nourishing your nails.</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Justlife?</strong></h3><ul><li><p><strong>Expert Technicians:</strong> Our team consists of highly trained and experienced nail artists who stay ahead of the trends to provide you with the best service possible.</p></li><li><p><strong>Quality Products:</strong> We use only the highest quality products to ensure your nails look great and are treated with the utmost care.</p></li><li><p><strong>Convenience:</strong> Easily book appointments online through justlife.com for services at our salons or enjoy our mobile nail services, where we bring the salon experience to your home.</p></li><li><p><strong>Customer Satisfaction:</strong> At Justlife, your satisfaction is our top priority. We're dedicated to providing you with a delightful and fulfilling nail care experience.</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Ready to Transform Your Nails?</strong></h2><p>Don't settle for less when it comes to your nails. Embrace the latest trends, express your unique style, and enjoy the confidence that comes with immaculate nails. Visit us at <a href="https://www.justlife.com/">justlife.com</a> to explore our <a href="https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/salon-services-at-home">salon services at home</a>, find inspiration, and book your appointment today. With Justlife, beautiful nails are just the beginning. Step into a world where beauty, care, and personalized attention converge to create the ultimate nail care experience. Let's make every nail moment count. </p></div><div class="FeaturedSection_featuredContainer__8U5Xt"><h2 class="">Featured Articles</h2><div class="FeaturedSection_blogCardWrapper__mrozQ"><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/what-is-aromatherapy-massage"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvIpf"><img alt="blog-image" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="408" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BlogCard_blogImage__70GAU BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/42bc63e1b8/aromatherapy-massage.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">Aromatherapy Massage: What It Is &amp; How It Works</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Learn what aromatherapy massage is, how essential oils work with massage therapy, key benefits, safety tips, and what to expect from a session.</p></a><a target="_se