ium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/3439822c61/how-to-lose-weight.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">How to Lose Weight? Steps &amp; Tips for Weight Management</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Learn how to lose weight with science-backed steps for fat loss, nutrition, exercise, mindset, and long-term weight management that actually lasts.</p></a><div class="JustlifeCard_justlifeCardContainer__MmFeH"><img alt="justlife-logo" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="180" height="57" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="JustlifeCard_justlifeCardImage__2Io8d" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:3.1578947368421053" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/181x57/b21180d1cf/justlife-logo.svg"/><p class="JustlifeCard_justlifeCardTitle__5GtrP text-head-2">Tired of juggling home tasks?</p><a target="_self" class="JustlifeCard_justlifeCardButton__K6SRM" href="https://just.life/YQBgj2"><p class="text-white g-inline-block">Download Justlife</p></a><p class="text-subtitle-1">Everything your home needs, in one tap.</p></div><a target="_self" class="BlogCard_blogCarContainer__4mbWt BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" href="/blog/en-AE/what-is-dry-cleaning"><div class="BlogCard_blogCardImageWrapper__zvIpf"><img alt="blog-image" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="408" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="BlogCard_blogImage__70GAU BlogCard_medium__eY9iQ" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:1.8545454545454545" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/1536x1024/c9bb49e70b/what-is-dry-cleaning.webp/m/680x453/filters:format(webp)"/></div><h3 class="BlogCard_blogCardTitle__F8eRV ">What Is Dry Cleaning? The Process Behind Dry Cleaning</h3><p class="BlogCard_blogCardDescription__P9zo5">Learn what dry cleaning is, how the process works, why solvents are used, and when dry cleaning protects delicate clothes better than washing at professional cleaners.</p></a></div></div><div class="GoogleMapSection_googleMapSectionContainer__GNjwk"><p class="GoogleMapSection_googleMapSectionTitle__SE2Eg text-head-2">Service Areas</p><div style="height:340px;width:100%px" data-ntpc="GoogleMapsEmbed"><iframe loading="lazy" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/view?key=AIzaSyCRSkwAk8tsoOaNvWjd_XVkgam0pE3HOEc&center=24.950189%2C+55.070096&zoom=8" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" frameborder="0" style="border-radius:0.625rem" width="100%" height="340"></iframe></div></div><div class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionContainer__ixyh_"><div class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionWrapper__HiYvt"><div class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionTextWrapper__DmMLy"><p class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionTitle__K78WT text-head-2">About us</p><p class="">We’re Justlife, your one-stop super app for everything home.<br/><br/>What began in 2015 as Justmop has grown into the region’s go-to platform for cleaning, beauty, healthcare, maintenance, and more.<br/><br/>With over 10 million bookings completed and thousands of professionals across the GCC, our belief is simple: life is better when it’s clean, manageable, and cared for. That’s the best kind of clean slate.</p></div><div class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionImage__WwbGw"><img alt="mobile-apps" fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" width="395" height="450" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="MobileAppSection_mobileAppSectionImage__WwbGw" style="color:transparent;aspect-ratio:0.8777777777777778" src="https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/407x463/7718844817/mobile-apps-v2.png/m/680x774/filters:format(webp)"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--><div class="Footer_footerContainer__t8QY0"><div class="Footer_footerWrapper__LB7u5"><div class="Footer_servicesContainer__wgnwn"><h3 class="Footer_serviceTitle__YmjVI text-head-2">Services</h3><div class="Footer_servicesWrapper__VN6_P"><a id="footer-service-chip-9b00d940