"Men's Salon Service\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"chipId\":\"footer-service-chip-4202605b-308f-4085-a056-73e50b7880f4\",\"chipSlug\":\"https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/mens-salon\"}]]}]\n43:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",\"footer-services-chip-797dc5b6-d231-4c46-8484-ee3ea01c2968\",{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"href\":\"https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/pet-grooming\",\"locale\":\"$undefined\",\"localeCookie\":\"$1b:props:localeCookie\",\"id\":\"footer-service-chip-797dc5b6-d231-4c46-8484-ee3ea01c2968\",\"prefetch\":false,\"target\":\"_self\",\"className\":\"Chip_chipContainer__KMeax Chip_default__xuX8i \",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-subtitle-1 text-white g-inline-block\",\"children\":\"Pet Grooming Service\"}],[\"$\",\"$L33\",null,{\"chipId\":\"footer-service"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"-chip-797dc5b6-d231-4c46-8484-ee3ea01c2968\",\"chipSlug\":\"https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/pet-grooming\"}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"44:I[2837,[\"486\",\"static/chunks/486-5a44907e277a131a.js\",\"125\",\"static/chunks/125-f450f4579c256eda.js\",\"403\",\"static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/%5BblogSlug%5D/page-c4970773b9d50890.js\"],\"default\"]\n4f:I[8930,[\"486\",\"static/chunks/486-5a44907e277a131a.js\",\"125\",\"static/chunks/125-f450f4579c256eda.js\",\"403\",\"static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/%5BblogSlug%5D/page-c4970773b9d50890.js\"],\"\"]\n51:I[9243,[\"486\",\"static/chunks/486-5a44907e277a131a.js\",\"125\",\"static/chunks/125-f450f4579c256eda.js\",\"403\",\"static/chunks/app/%5Blocale%5D/%5BblogSlug%5D/page-c4970773b9d50890.js\"],\"\"]\n48:T1b87,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eHey there, beauty aficionados! Ever stood in front of a salon mirror pondering the eternal question, \"What nail shape speaks to me?\" You're not alone. The world of manicures is vast and varied, with types of nail shapes for every mood, personality, and lifestyle. Whether you're a fan of the elegance of oval nails or the daring allure of stiletto nails, there's a shape out there that's your perfect fit. I've teamed up with the experts at Justlife to bring you the ultimate guide to different nail shapes, ensuring your next salon visit is a breeze. Let's dive into the fabulous world of nails and discover which shape is your soulmate.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Ultimate Guide to Nail Shapes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound Shape Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimple, classic, and effortlessly chic, round shape nails are the go-to for those who cherish a timeless look. Perfect for shorter nails, they make your fingers appear longer and are a breeze to maintain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSquare Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eBold and striking, square nails are all about making a statement. With their straight edges and sharp corners, they're the epitome of edgy sophistication. Ideal for those with longer nail beds looking to add some drama to their digits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOval Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOval nails are the essence of elegance. Their elongated shape offers a soft, feminine vibe that works beautifully on any hand. They're incredibly versatile, making them a fantastic pick for nail enthusiasts of all stripes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSquoval Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCan't decide between square and oval? Squoval nails are your answer. This hybrid shape brings the best of both worlds, offering the strength of square tips with the grace of oval edges. It's a universally flattering shape that's both modern and stylish.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAlmond Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNamed after the nut, almond nails are for those who love a bit of drama. Tapering to a rounded point, they elongate the hands and provide a perfect canvas for intricate nail art. Almond nails are a surefire way to add a touch of glamour to your look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStiletto Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNot for the faint of heart, stiletto nails are bold, pointed, and unapologetically fierce. They're a favorite for making a fashion statement and turning heads. While they might not be the most practical, they're perfect for special occasions where you want to stand out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoffin Shaped Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCoffin-shaped nails, or ballerina's nails, are the trendsetters' choice. Tapered with a flat tip, they're sleek, sophisticated, and utterly chic. Popular among celebs, these nails are ideal for those who love to stay ahead of the curve.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShort Almond Nails\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eLove the almond look but need something a bit more low-key? Short almond nails have got you covered. Offering the elegance of the almond shape in a more manageable length, they're perfect for everyday glam.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNail Trends\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe upcoming year promises an exciting mix of personal expression and versatility in nail trends. Here's what's making waves:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAlmond Nails:\u003c/strong\u003e Continuing their reign for their sleek, stylish appeal, perfect for those seeking elegance with a dash of modernity.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoffin Shapes:\u003c/strong\u003e Bold and fashion-forward, these nails are set to make a statement for those who dare to stand out.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShort Square Nails:\u003c/strong\u003e Returning with a practical charm, ideal for a neat, clean look that's easy to maintain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSquoval Shapes:\u003c/strong\u003e Merging the best of square and oval, squoval nails offer a uniquely practical beauty.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCreative Almond Nail Designs:\u003c/strong\u003e Serving as a canvas for endless creativity, almond nails invite personalized expressions of style.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrench Nails:\u003c/strong\u003e A timeless classic, French nails are getting a modern twist with new colors and innovative designs, proving once again their enduring appeal.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePastel Tones:\u003c/strong\u003e Soft, soothing pastels will continue to be a favorite, offering a delicate splash of color suitable for any occasion.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJustlife: Your Ultimate Nail Care Destination\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt Justlife, we understand that your nails are an extension of your personality. That's why we offer a wide range of nail services tailored to meet your individual needs and preferences. Whether you're looking for the latest almond nail designs, dreaming of sophisticated coffin-shaped nails, or wanting to keep things classic with round or oval nails, our expert technicians are here to make it happen.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Nail Care Services\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur services go beyond just applying polish. We offer comprehensive nail care, including:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConsultations: To help you choose the perfect nail shape and design based on your lifestyle, nail health, and personal style.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustomized Manicures: From short square nails to stiletto nails, we customize each manicure to suit your chosen shape and finish it with impeccable polish application or nail art.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNail Health Treatments: Ensuring your nails are not only beautiful but healthy too, with treatments that cater to strengthening and nourishing your nails.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Justlife?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExpert Technicians:\u003c/strong\u003e Our team consists of highly trained and experienced nail artists who stay ahead of the trends to provide you with the best service possible.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuality Products:\u003c/strong\u003e We use only the highest quality products to ensure your nails look great and are treated with the utmost care.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConvenience:\u003c/strong\u003e Easily book appointments online through justlife.com for services at our salons or enjoy our mobile nail services, where we bring the salon experience to your home.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomer Satisfaction:\u003c/strong\u003e At Justlife, your satisfaction is our top priority. We're dedicated to providing you with a delightful and fulfilling nail care experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReady to Transform Your Nails?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDon't settle for less when it comes to your nails. Embrace the latest trends, express your unique style, and enjoy the confidence that comes with immaculate nails. Visit us at \u003ca href=\"https://www.justlife.com/\"\u003ejustlife.com\u003c/a\u003e to explore our \u003ca href=\"https://www.justlife.com/en-AE/salon-services-at-home\"\u003esalon services at home\u003c/a\u003e, find inspiration, and book your appointment today. With Justlife, beautiful nails are just the beginning. Step into a world where beauty, care, and personalized attention converge to create the ultimate nail care experience. Let's make every nail moment count. \u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"blogdetail-page-container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L44\",null,{\"pageName\":\"BlogDetail\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white g-flow-root\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbGroupContainer__w36yz\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"Home-https://www.justlife.com/en-AE\",{\"children\":[\"$L45\",[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"src\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg\",\"alt\":\"chevron-right\",\"width\":8,\"height\":12,\"className\":\"BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip\",\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"auto\",\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"aspectRatio\":\"0.6666666666666666\"}}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"Blog-/\",{\"children\":[\"$L46\",[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"src\":\"https://a.storyblok.com/f/285972427025846/7x10/bed1910ac4/chevron-right.svg\",\"alt\":\"chevron-right\",\"width\":8,\"height\":12,\"className\":\"BreadcrumbGroup_breadcrumbIcon__Qxy6t rtl-flip\",\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"auto\",\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"style\":{\"aspectRatio\":\"0.6666666666666666\"}}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"Nailing It: Finding Your P